abstract: >-
  Public research archive (October 2025 to July 2026) on machine-native
  discrete reasoning: an air-gapped encoder/decoder that must communicate
  through discrete IR tokens, graded by a causal-necessity standard
  (performance must beat baseline and collapse under token perturbation).
  Contains one small-scale mechanism proof (V17), three characterized
  negative results, and the primary run records.
